From 71d4953b8a644f380e7236928d4d5cdbada5b233 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 06:05:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 197/199] Patch 0196: less waiting, widened. Battle x2 in every
 battle: the R2 switch, its plate and the arming are resident (modSpeedInput,
 modSpeedPlateAdd, modSpeedBeforeTick, mod_qol.c), shared by BTL, STD (from a
 match's intro to its end; its finisher charge counts a press twice at x2) and
 VS (its fight loop, R2 of the first pad). Every evolution can be skipped with
 START, the plate says START SKIP / START OMITIR (by MOD_LANG). Training x5 is
 the gym menu's row: the script sets the Bonus Try flag (pstat 246) to 2, the
 session's setup turns it into a normal session in a block (modBlockArm); the
 R2 switch and its plate are gone

